================================================================================
FILE INTEGRITY MONITORING - C:\USERS (ACTIVE/REALTIME)
================================================================================

FILE: fim-users-config.xml
TARGET: Windows Agent
PURPOSE: Monitor C:\Users secara realtime, deteksi file creation/modification

================================================================================
CARA PAKAI:
================================================================================

1. Di WINDOWS AGENT, edit file:
   C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf

2. Cari section <syscheck>, GANTI dengan config ini:

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
<ossec_config>
  <syscheck>
    <!-- Monitor C:\Users secara realtime -->
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users</directories>

    <!-- Extension yang diabaikan (file sementara) -->
    <ignore type="sregex">\.tmp$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.log$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.temp$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.db$</ignore>

    <!-- Frequency scan (backup, 1x per hari) -->
    <frequency>86400</frequency>

    <!-- Alert jika ada perubahan -->
    <alerts>
      <alert_if_changes>yes</alert_if_changes>
    </alerts>
  </syscheck>
</ossec_config>
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

3. Restart Agent:

   net stop ossec
   net start ossec

   atau via PowerShell Admin:
   Restart-Service -Name "Wazuh"

================================================================================
VERIFIKASI:
================================================================================

1. Cek ossec.conf sudah ter-update:
   type "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf"

2. Cek agent terhubung ke Manager:
   Buka Dashboard > Agents > Status: Active

3. Test: Buat file di C:\Users\<nama>\Desktop
   Lihat alert di Dashboard > Security Events

================================================================================
WHITELIST (JANGAN DIALERT):
================================================================================

Tambahkan <ignore> untuk path yang tidak perlu di-monitor:

   <ignore>C:\Users\username\AppData\Local\Temp</ignore>
   <ignore>C:\Users\username\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Windows\INetCache</ignore>
   <ignore>C:\Windows\System32\config\systemprofile\AppData\Local\Temp</ignore>

================================================================================
MONITOR FOLDER TERTENTU SAJA (LEBIH SPESIFIK):
================================================================================

Kalau mau monitor hanya folder tertentu di Users:

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
<ossec_config>
  <syscheck>
    <!-- Monitor Downloads, Documents, Desktop -->
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\*\Downloads</directories>
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\*\Documents</directories>
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\*\Desktop</directories>

    <!-- Monitor startup folder (deteksi malware persistence) -->
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\*\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup</directories>

    <!-- Ignore temporary files -->
    <ignore type="sregex">\.tmp$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.temp$</ignore>

    <frequency>86400</frequency>
  </syscheck>
</ossec_config>
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

================================================================================
DASHBOARD ALERT: CARA CEK FILE CHANGES
================================================================================

1. Buka Dashboard: https://localhost:443
2. Menu: Security Events
3. Filter dengan query:
   rule.id: 554 (file added)
   rule.id: 550 (file modified)
   rule.id: 553 (file deleted)

Atau cari:
   "syscheck":*"path":"C:\\Users"

